cff-version: 1.2.0
title: GUISkinDose
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it and also credit the upstream
  PySkinDose project as appropriate.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hellström
    given-names: Max
  - name: "GUISkinDose contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kgrizz-git/GUISkinDose"
url: "https://github.com/kgrizz-git/GUISkinDose"
abstract: >-
  Independently maintained fork of PySkinDose for estimating peak skin dose and
  3D skin dose maps from fluoroscopic RDSR and tabular inputs. Not FDA-cleared;
  intended for research, education, development, and institutional QA.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - skin dose
  - fluoroscopy
  - RDSR
  - DICOM
  - medical physics
references:
  - type: software
    title: PySkinDose
    repository-code: "https://github.com/rvbCMTS/PySkinDose"
    authors:
      - family-names: Hellström
        given-names: Max
    notes: Upstream project that this fork is based on.
